# CmdDropdown for domain & account pickers

Full spec: [docs/desktop/cmd-dropdown-ui.md](../../docs/desktop/cmd-dropdown-ui.md)

- **CmdDropdown** (`@/components/ui/cmd-dropdown`) for Worker **domains** and Console **account/sender email** lists (searchable popover).
- **Select** (`@/components/ui/select`) for short static enums (purpose, template id, display name when list is tiny).
- Pair `Label` + `triggerId` on `CmdDropdown`. Use `triggerClassName="min-w-0"` in grids.
- Do not confuse with mail **Cmd+K** (`app/src/email/commands/`).
